WEBVTT

00:00:08.447 --> 00:00:13.401
Great. It's 6 o'clock. Can I call
order and stand for the pledge of
allegiance.

00:00:20.508 --> 00:00:23.823
I pledge allegiance to the Flag of
the United States of America,

00:00:23.903 --> 00:00:29.580
and to the Republic for which it
stands, one Nation under God,
indivisible,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.290
with liberty and justice for all.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.273
All right.

00:00:33.353 --> 00:00:35.444
Miss Mon Taz, roll call, please.

00:00:35.524 --> 00:00:36.357
Mr. Laki.

00:00:36.437 --> 00:00:37.270
Here.
